@startuml Netty sync() 执行时序图
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Netty ChannelFuture.sync() 阻塞唤醒机制详解

actor "调用线程\n(你的代码)" as Caller
participant "Bootstrap" as Bootstrap
participant "DefaultChannelPromise\n(对象 0x12345678)" as Promise #LightBlue
participant "EventLoop 线程" as EventLoop
participant "对象监视器\n(ObjectMonitor)" as Monitor #LightGreen
participant "WaitSet\n(等待队列)" as WaitSet #LightYellow

== 阶段1: 创建连接和 Promise 对象 ==

Caller -> Bootstrap: connect(host, port)
activate Bootstrap

Bootstrap -> Promise: new DefaultChannelPromise()
activate Promise
note right of Promise: 创建对象实例\n地址: 0x12345678\nisDone = false

Bootstrap -> EventLoop: doConnect(promise)
activate EventLoop
note right of EventLoop: 异步连接操作开始\n持有 promise 引用\n(同一个对象 0x12345678)

Bootstrap --> Caller: return promise (0x12345678)
deactivate Bootstrap

== 阶段2: 调用 sync() 开始阻塞 ==

Caller -> Promise: sync()
activate Promise

Promise -> Promise: await()
activate Promise

Promise -> Monitor: synchronized(this)
activate Monitor
note right of Monitor: 获取对象 0x12345678\n的监视器锁

Promise -> Promise: isDone() == false?
activate Promise
Promise --> Promise: false (未完成)
deactivate Promise

Promise -> WaitSet: wait()
activate WaitSet
note right of WaitSet: 1. 将调用线程加入\n   WaitSet 队列\n2. 释放监视器锁\n3. 线程进入 WAITING 状态

WaitSet --> Monitor: 释放锁
deactivate Monitor

WaitSet --> Caller: **线程阻塞在这里** ⏸️
deactivate WaitSet
deactivate Promise
deactivate Promise

== 阶段3: EventLoop 完成连接 ==

EventLoop -> EventLoop: 执行 TCP 连接操作
note right of EventLoop: 网络 I/O 操作\n建立 TCP 连接

EventLoop -> EventLoop: 连接成功

== 阶段4: 设置成功并唤醒 ==

EventLoop -> Promise: setSuccess(result)
activate Promise

Promise -> Monitor: synchronized(this)
activate Monitor
note right of Monitor: 获取同一个对象\n0x12345678 的监视器锁

Promise -> Promise: setSuccess0(result)
activate Promise
Promise -> Promise: this.result = result
Promise -> Promise: this.isDone = true
deactivate Promise

Promise -> Promise: hasWaiters()?
activate Promise
Promise --> Promise: true (有等待线程)
deactivate Promise

Promise -> Monitor: notifyAll()
activate Monitor
note right of Monitor: 唤醒对象 0x12345678\n的 WaitSet 中的所有线程

Monitor -> WaitSet: 遍历 WaitSet
activate WaitSet
WaitSet -> WaitSet: 将所有等待线程\n从 WaitSet 移到 EntryList
WaitSet --> Monitor: 线程状态变为 BLOCKED
deactivate WaitSet

Monitor --> Promise: 唤醒完成
deactivate Monitor

Promise --> EventLoop: 返回
deactivate Promise
deactivate Monitor

== 阶段5: 调用线程被唤醒 ==

WaitSet -> Caller: **线程被唤醒** ▶️
activate Caller

Caller -> Monitor: 重新竞争锁
activate Monitor
Monitor --> Caller: 获取锁成功
deactivate Monitor

Caller -> Promise: isDone()?
activate Promise
Promise --> Caller: true (已完成)
deactivate Promise

Caller -> Promise: 退出 while 循环
Caller -> Promise: 释放锁
deactivate Promise

Promise --> Caller: sync() 返回
deactivate Caller

== 阶段6: 检查结果 ==

Caller -> Promise: isSuccess()?
activate Promise
Promise --> Caller: true
deactivate Promise

Caller -> Promise: channel()
activate Promise
Promise --> Caller: 返回 Channel 对象
deactivate Promise

@enduml

